DESCRIPTION:Amazing Selections offered by Marvelous Artists. A Whole Month of Hot Buys. The Artery offers a cool retreat from the August sun with our Annual Summer Sale. Our artists have filled the gallery with drastically reduced treasures and will add new inventory throughout the month. Your favorite artist or one of our newest members might surprise you with a “must have” at just the right price. Our wonderful choices: Paintings\, Photography\, Prints\, Jewelry\, Woodwork\, Woven baskets\, Ceramics\, Gourds\, Greeting Cards\, Fiber Art\, Glass: Fused and Blown.
