SUMMARY:Get to Know Your Sewing Machine!
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a sewing machine but don’t feel comfortable using it? Now is your chance to become a confident sewing machine user! In this one-day workshop\, students will learn basic sewing machine maintenance including how to properly thread their machine\, troubleshoot common stitching problems\, and gain a better understanding of how their machine works.\n● Sewing machines are not provided\n● All other materials will be provided\n● Children under 8 must be accompanied by an adult\nInstructor: Courtney Siperstein-Cook\nALL AGES\nPrice: $35\nTime: 10:00a-1:00p\nWorkshop date:\nSaturday\, August 1
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/get-to-know-your-sewing-machine/
