SUMMARY:Discover Berryessa Snow Mountain National Monument with Author Marc Hoshovsky
DESCRIPTION:Learn more about this fascinating landscape\, located just west and north of Davis in the northern Coast Ranges. Marc Hoshovsky\, coauthor of the recently published guidebook titled\, Exploring the Berryessa Snow Mountain National Monument Region\, will share the wonders of this landscape\, one shaped by ancient tectonic forces\, uplifted ocean crust\, and volcanic seamounts that have drawn the attention of geologists from around the world. Beyond its scientific significance\, the monument offers rugged beauty\, diverse wildlife habitats\, scenic hiking opportunities\, and traces of California’s rich mining heritage waiting to be discovered. Their new guidebook\, which will be available for sale and author signing\, is well-illustrated\, tells captivating stories\, and provides detailed maps and route descriptions that allow you to explore the region on your own.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/discover-berryessa-snow-mountain-national-monument-with-author-marc-hoshovsky/
LOCATION:REI Sacramento\, 1790 Expo Pkwy\, Sacramento\, CA\, 95815\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Front-Cover-final.jpg
END:VEVENT
