SUMMARY:The Davis Bookworms
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to make time for reading? Join The Davis Bookworms! Bring whatever book you’re reading or want to read. We read together for an hour and then discuss what we read for about an hour. After that\, the conversation goes in whatever direction it wants to go. Every other Sunday.
